# Manifold level 10
# The towers (stage 5n; rebuilt in 5o, decision 0031: levels of floors above floors). From the south bank,
# a moat 8 m across and 3 m down: a ferry crosses it, a bridge at its west end, a stair out of it at its
# east; under the bank, behind a door a hand opens, armor and grenades. North, a courtyard between two
# round towers 14 m across. The west one has a lift to its top, 6 m up, and the longshot there; from it a
# bridge crosses to the east one's top, the yellow key, and those who charge are called. In the east one
# a stair rises to a landing and another turns back over it. The yellow door is the courtyard's north: past
# it, the way out. Drawn as a plan (plans/level-3.plan, made by a script).
title The towers
spawn 0 1 1
facing 0 0 -1
ambient 0.32
sky 5.5

